TEXT -288 -560 Left 5 ;ECE455 Rev B  ·  isolated ±5 V low-noise supply
TEXT -288 -488 Left 3 ;Bench 01  ·  start-up + 50 mA load step on +5 V
TEXT -288 -440 Left 2 ;12 V -> pi-filter -> MEJ2D1209SC (±9 V, 5.2 kVDC) -> LC pre-filter -> LT3045 / LT3094 -> ±5 V
TEXT -288 -400 Left 2 ;proton magnetometer analog front end  ·  Patrick Muyenzi
TEXT -288 -352 Left 1 ;drawn by scripts/build_ltspice.py: change the script and re-run it so every bench stays in sync
RECTANGLE Normal 1392 576 -320 368 2
TEXT -288 408 Left 3 ;NOTES
TEXT -288 456 Left 2 ;V1 ramps 0 -> 12 V in 1 ms; RLP = RLN = 100 ohm (50 mA per rail); ILP adds 50 mA on +5 V at 40-50 ms\nC11 / C13 = 47 nF here so the LDOs settle fast; the board's 4.7 µF: bench 08\nrun it: the plot opens with every rail in one pane (01_startup_loadstep.plt)\nLDO resistors from the design: R5 = R9 = 49.9k (±4.99 V), R6 = 499, R10 = 3.74k
RECTANGLE Normal 4064 1000 -320 624 0
TEXT -288 664 Left 3 ;SIMULATION
TEXT -288 704 Left 1 ;analysis
TEXT -288 744 Left 2 !.tran 0 60m 0 100n uic\n.options plotwinsize=0\n.param T1=35m T2=39.5m\n.lib MEJ2D12xxSC.lib\n.save V(VIN) V(VIN_MOD) V(P9V_RAW) V(N9V_RAW)\n+ V(P9V_F) V(N9V_F) V(P5V) V(N5V) V(ISO_0V)\n+ I(V1) I(RLP) I(RLN)
TEXT 560 704 Left 1 ;steady state in the T1..T2 window: rail voltages, input power
TEXT 560 744 Left 2 !.meas tran Vp  avg V(P5V,ISO_0V) from {T1} to {T2}\n.meas tran Vn  avg V(N5V,ISO_0V) from {T1} to {T2}\n.meas tran V9p avg V(P9V_F,ISO_0V) from {T1} to {T2}\n.meas tran V9n avg V(N9V_F,ISO_0V) from {T1} to {T2}\n.meas tran Pin  avg -V(VIN)*I(V1) from {T1} to {T2}\n.meas tran Iin  avg -I(V1) from {T1} to {T2}
TEXT 1632 704 Left 1 ;45 kHz ripple through the filter chain, output power, efficiency
TEXT 1632 744 Left 2 !.meas tran Vp_pp_raw pp V(P9V_RAW,ISO_0V) from {T1} to {T2}\n.meas tran Vp_pp_f   pp V(P9V_F,ISO_0V) from {T1} to {T2}\n.meas tran Vp_pp     pp V(P5V,ISO_0V) from {T1} to {T2}\n.meas tran Vn_pp     pp V(N5V,ISO_0V) from {T1} to {T2}\n.meas tran Pout avg V(P5V,ISO_0V)*I(RLP)-V(N5V,ISO_0V)*I(RLN) from {T1} to {T2}\n.meas tran eff param Pout/Pin
TEXT 2880 704 Left 1 ;start-up time, load step response, inrush
TEXT 2880 744 Left 2 !.meas tran t_p45 when V(P5V,ISO_0V)=4.5 rise=1\n.meas tran t_n45 when V(N5V,ISO_0V)=-4.5 fall=1\n.meas tran Vp_min  min V(P5V,ISO_0V) from 40m to 50m\n.meas tran Vp_max  max V(P5V,ISO_0V) from 50m to 60m\n.meas tran Vp_step avg V(P5V,ISO_0V) from 45m to 49.5m\n.meas tran Vn_step avg V(N5V,ISO_0V) from 45m to 49.5m\n.meas tran Iin_peak max -I(V1) from 0 to 10m
